[{"kind":"html","html":"<p>An individual column option in a picker. Visit the <a class=\"\" href=\"/components/picker\"><code>ion-picker</code></a> documentation for more details.</p>"},{"kind":"heading","level":2,"id":"properties","text":"Properties"},{"kind":"heading","level":3,"id":"prop-color","text":"color"},{"kind":"html","html":"<div class=\"tableWrapper_flOe\"><table><tbody><tr><td><strong>Description</strong></td><td>The color to use from your application's color palette. Default options are: <code>\"primary\"</code>, <code>\"secondary\"</code>, <code>\"tertiary\"</code>, <code>\"success\"</code>, <code>\"warning\"</code>, <code>\"danger\"</code>, <code>\"light\"</code>, <code>\"medium\"</code>, and <code>\"dark\"</code>. For more information on colors, see <a class=\"\" href=\"https://ionicframework.com/docs/theming/basics\">theming</a>.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Attribute</strong></td><td><code>color</code></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Type</strong></td><td><code>\"danger\" ｜ \"dark\" ｜ \"light\" ｜ \"medium\" ｜ \"primary\" ｜ \"secondary\" ｜ \"success\" ｜ \"tertiary\" ｜ \"warning\" ｜ string ｜ undefined</code></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default</strong></td><td><code>undefined</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div>"},{"kind":"heading","level":3,"id":"prop-disabled","text":"disabled"},{"kind":"html","html":"<div class=\"tableWrapper_flOe\"><table><tbody><tr><td><strong>Description</strong></td><td>If <code>true</code>, the user cannot interact with the picker column option.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Attribute</strong></td><td><code>disabled</code></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Type</strong></td><td><code>boolean</code></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default</strong></td><td><code>false</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div>"},{"kind":"heading","level":3,"id":"prop-value","text":"value"},{"kind":"html","html":"<div class=\"tableWrapper_flOe\"><table><tbody><tr><td><strong>Description</strong></td><td>The text value of the option.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Attribute</strong></td>